---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Rastrigin Systems Ltd"
  description="Rastrigin Systems Ltd is a software company in the United Kingdom that builds and owns consumer software and the engines behind it."
>
  <div class="opening">
    <h1 class="title">Rastrigin Systems Ltd</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A software company in the United Kingdom that builds and owns consumer software and the engines behind it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="owns">
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="owns">What the company owns</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <ul class="holdings">
        <li class="holding">
          <p class="holding-name"><a href="https://asukodance.com">Asuko Dance</a></p>
          <p class="holding-what">A virtual performer who lives on your desktop and dances to whatever music you play.</p>
          <p class="holding-how">Native macOS and Windows shells around a WebGL scene; a music-analysis schema and a motion pipeline that turns reference video into baked animation.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="holding">
          <p class="holding-name"><a href="https://gettalkbar.com">Talkbar</a></p>
          <p class="holding-what">A black pill in the Mac menu bar: speak, and your words are typed where your cursor is.</p>
          <p class="holding-how">On-device speech recognition; an optional voice for coding agents.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="holding">
          <p class="holding-name">The engine</p>
          <p class="holding-what">The music-to-choreography pipeline behind Asuko.</p>
          <p class="holding-how">Analysis of a track into a structured schema, a choreographer that plans a dance from it, and baked motion clips. Proprietary.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how">
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="how">How it works</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>
        A small studio. We design, build and operate our products in-house, and own the code and the characters outright. Much of the generation, rendering and review is done by AI agents working under human direction.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="company">
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="company">Company</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Legal name</dt><dd>Rastrigin Systems Ltd</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Registered in</dt><dd>England and Wales</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Company number</dt><dd class="mono">16920450</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Incorporated</dt><dd class="mono">18 December 2025</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Registered office</dt><dd>19 Tre Lowen, Pentire Crescent, Newquay, Cornwall, TR7 1FQ, United Kingdom</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="contact">
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p><a class="mono" href="mailto:info@rastrigin.systems">info@rastrigin.systems</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
